{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>【TGS2026】「KONAMI」攤位報導！惡魔城與Konami密技等週年紀念展示一應俱全</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6de45ae532b23f68f77a2ae1e6cfc03b43c62f3ffcc1fbbeb74c7651ca8aeb7e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F5cf6ee50a8aee4771ed486fd7b1980b5.jpg\"/><p>2026年9月17日(四)～20日(日)4天期間舉辦的遊戲慶典「 東京電玩展2026 (TGS2026)」 這次要報導「 KONAMI 」攤位！</p><h3>報導「KONAMI」攤位！今年投入程度非常驚人</h3><p>KONAMI攤位 直播工作室</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e3b9426f23aa804b364b042e1091b5e9433ec78e5238342e075bb34c17bf0510/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F4c5d585b96400337162b79d0819fe409.jpg\"/><p>潛入TGS常客企業之一的「KONAMI」攤位！ 今年迎接值得紀念里程碑的系列眾多，因此比往年更加投入。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6b246ef0f38997bc761665e9965d0dcf91a30aeedf6b4866af9179f26039cb05/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F587e3131bf166b45fc9e1a785fa5b3e6.png\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/eed3e7b3a024fe61c4594103befd0c8022c22cbd88af99ef02be6084366c2d29/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F892c4ed6baf2902eafb898728e3113fc.png\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/cba6663d9dfa4d9a3838f6b32ee62ee96f36f869596fefa61fd1aaf1d53312bf/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fb5868d5e8e31bbf4247216eca045b73e.png\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8fb1296f19d8d3705e27a53be6109e4145d6fcd2c9492c278d0a31341fbad728/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fc6e6635bdd27cc175eddd8461a1b70a5.png\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/56efa285391ee757ae2383b86daa63a566276e918f8908b6c9a554049bdd4fc8/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa310d667b1309432242b2781c555c61b.png\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/384f4fc1023f8dfc516560e2a188c783346c2fdaf0c6ee0cd73565270b6cde42/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fb9da446e650ce07cd19e2529af40f59b.png\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8503239f3333d1daaaed4b7de75369c91d3a43db95c35785c0c11f81d981911b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F56551d9299d2725017921e02751a73f7.png\"/><p>說起TGS就是試玩！ 「 遊戲王 TAG FORCE GX 」等期待作品當然不用說。 今年以「合作作品」形式，由各家企業並肩參展。 合計近30款遊戲可以試玩。</p><p>「Castlevania: Belmont's Curse」試玩區</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/09a37f740ba20129dfc43331aeb951cb5dd6d26470d3e494806ebfb7e8476437/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F00da09b779bcf3f2fdd9bfc0beeeec00.png\"/><p>其中最盛況空前的，是以城堡為意象外觀的「 Castlevania: Belmont's Curse 」試玩區。 整理券發放區甚至設在離城堡有段距離的地方，可見其熱烈程度。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/9cbab52222fce70ba65c8390b26fdc179b2594db38302a131a346db0d4b24fc6/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F0fab3809e62b18a9ec8b0a0cbad2537b.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/853f805814aefd00b9501e13a32c948ba480cbdd39964142a5102d85913bc43f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F53972ddd4f0ea28cb73902176b06710e.png\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1cc066ad9df985febabe83e72d3662c63cb54a6753eb2a7853a2de40f86737e9/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F25fe9ba179b23c4a290834e77c73f102.png\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7b14810f390d12223f7a263f70ef84b810852d58f2e2a8ea89ead73a6e5949cc/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F8c5280171e71bf696106bd39b34a16f3.jpg\"/><p>試玩區的內裝也非常講究，簡直就像惡魔城內部。 尤其是死神的裝飾品，巨大到無法從近處拍攝。</p><p>超、超大・・・！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/861e5f9cb6ec26c7c9ec3a2411d1e86f4106b969b74bf5c5fd624b677e75ad83/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F1814b8e2c24f1439da61436b60b1d88e.png\"/><p>試玩區正旁邊，設置了以德古拉伯爵玉座為意象的拍照景點。 可以實際坐上去拍攝。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7499ef6fb5cb3bf28c1746151132dfb6392f1a260ebedbb0144cdc630671d533/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fd69014e949df4efb54540ba639cc2c76.png\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c3dd1475096b9fbe5cef40ebe7e8c32927c0a0fb88c94234cce4f2b23fa3b581/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fcf5f7077500c2ac50dcffa6c20e548b7.png\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/deca74ba05ab6f614e277913989955bc8dd973d86da03db180d0498946bfb1f9/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F594e66ca62da2c2534814ff2108074a3.png\"/><p>更在特定時機，出現了宛如從遊戲畫面中走出來般、超高品質的角色扮演者！ 我記得拍攝時被那股魄力逼得整個人往後仰。</p><h3>今年展示物品種類超豐富！</h3><p>2026年，是隱藏指令「↑↑↓↓←→←→BA(俗稱Konami密技)」首次搭載於「宇宙巡航艦」的40週年。 加上同時迎接週年的IP眾多，因此設置了大規模的展示區。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e5016f63b6cbc95511f84f382ab203c7a094c6d002dab5db4b059a000ba3023d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F8d5db515f0406de96592ec97ca2f30d7.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b1a35a61e32f3cf23fb1bb99953e183100203bb0b21bce0601b365cbfd53e474/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fbe56f77d2845280b3b17a45198900700.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/a9894ba27d8dd8027f821db3754036d037c8e0e8d89c50a4f3875203e3895ccc/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F73cb6c4e810ca258471a56345118f49f.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/a9f407e0fa9934c1c82262ae3116cdd349dc077a72d1b9d84d2158b045aa11bd/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F6ac27f44b29a881482c9786f5826a085.jpg\"/><p>惡魔城(Castlevania)不僅有新作試玩，這裡也展出。 歷代作品的主視覺等一字排開。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8241bf9e3d4b93220c6d7e0ef7bc741bb86f9a1b001df82f1f79e75bc898d2ca/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F00441504f17bcd89e0643cb19a569f95.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/dd6794de2dd9be92888edc80c938b8a959dffe0db65ab5d5b4ecc3fd75cefffb/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F195ab47348446245c37630de37ee4f1e.jpg\"/><p>惡魔城(X68000版) 設定資料</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/12d5e6b25b7e3d402c3d348b6f93f4aad952e54032516f43f168d7ea9a014373/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fd42a313f914f100d0a33cbac5bb9a7b4.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/a7620a9d6a01b39ae5f249dcddab057b61660d8668c733bcfda87c451ea56c05/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fbf26551708be04dee73452461b28359d.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/48725aa143a8771d98054bc5caa7d63df7f108bf11631807737d1da0bce5c5db/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F7deab6ffb28334336715f53ca7e96df1.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ce0add8b14b4cf267848db264f7e7a07706237881c5fb9c890ee8ed5dfcb8c3e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F73c1c34932f7be5ee843a042696991e3.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/504d01fbc94de2418ee520cae04f6773aa2a106ca64c09627fa695d333451093/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fe6bf0f855d8ea38d9622ebe411291960.jpg\"/><p>惡魔城X 月下夜想曲 設定資料</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/135883b40c45aa1c390bdbc4fdd7b6aa88c57d3082d9686bf04c527cac8e6670/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F6268df2201325862329dc597a67e2101.jpg\"/><p>其中，談到惡魔城系列不可或缺的「惡魔城(X68000版)」與「惡魔城X 月下夜想曲」，也展示了設定資料等。 連備註筆記也原樣保留。 太珍貴了・・・！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/d06d11150cc4a77122775675eda98aa31e4e7b655fe3e8e03ca5abfa9710e40a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F56e762946a9091710fc98e8197678f5d.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4ad8d4de9b63754b1ef0bb9ddda201448f10f9969f3170e2bdcc8e5e6976f48c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F823b84a8b838748dd42c9ef0bdbdb5ee.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e31dc27c452695c2380a4a03d404a03000ff22f4e75970eccccc84d4ebe4754c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fdd3a91f72184562b278759ed72c52afa.jpg\"/><p>「實況野球」的招牌模式「成功」今年迎接30週年。 精選了系列里程碑作品，刊載了遊戲卡與遊戲畫面。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/995418e4af5b1c5f49a4b27177621ae8dc445bb2241ce8d95f50231f9e592f92/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fb72af4ba8fb4d22d61cf33cf8529c7b9.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2d8c771abe2ee0ca36ea1520401653f67900bda587647382bb3bfa8e099e90e4/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F255cfe4a937ca0e36191958c64fba5e7.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8ea5c0fe53d5ac265bfdb24bf8e88b0f689e193220cd4bc32ca9b61856c38484/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F14525fdd6e77f19f855ec8164eea7171.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/344eaa61b16502e4c87506e9a5e38a255704ec888a4483bf0a4151659ce52893/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa36f3939e62d6e7f90cda78db73ae945.jpg\"/><p>配合40週年發售合輯的「大盜五右衛門」，歷代遊戲卡也一字排開。 仔細一看，今年發售作品的前一款作品是Nintendo DS的遊戲卡。 也曾一度中斷歷史的五右衛門，其完全新作也令人期待呢。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/98ccce391216a1b36f70b05438868609c6511014afe9ef3c5766d6536bff5d92/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F6592b8bd3acd859a1372213eade3e877.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/85d3aa396df022414f558f04819e6f0d3e76288b12361780ef50a3de2051553f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fdc83ef955fc8f2a52d11d6737ab085ed.jpg\"/><p>也設置了對五右衛門粉絲而言印象深刻的「高空彈跳空手奪白刃」拍照景點。 從作為靈感來源的小遊戲來看也是如此，但預想中的照片有點超現實。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/42a512db8ff929a62a03accd3f79d1c70c136c7ceb88f3eaa3e3a003bb52f806/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F9ab73dc40ac3674bda1d0880ab2be008.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e9169f5542ea13b20f32e1eb22e76fdc798698daa516456378582557be977d27/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ff05d3e7b13006fe1d9cd4bda147163a8.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/228b4a5a896ff40074a6ff1c996c2dc3c0f462bccad93b574538699012f33c14/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F1ef34e20886372ef6f72cb6d06bcdaa7.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/359c5ae281dde346f47c193254f47681cb1464430c97e4f661806cd2cbf6c4a7/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F3483d29fd606ed9b6073a34d5e6153bb.jpg\"/><p>去年發售的重製版成為話題的幻想水滸傳也迎接30週年。 在以今年剛推出的 幻想水滸傳 STAR LEAP 為焦點的同時，也刊載了系列年表。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4cd32b3d39411f0f08d0772cf60fec1cc324c59cf62abd9016ee72e49523d90f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F4e576ae160ecd0dd06453244d6fd3e98.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/a9392853667510baa02f0ed1606ef34c56eab5b30e1400b48c64b8c394d44dda/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fb474fe0cedc54f1509db014fa9ee7e41.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6ac66389caa7f475ac4642f6573b81f0c776e1fb57d9169ceffb7a8915131adc/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Feb7821615aa902cf0e4b8b0599b659b0.jpg\"/><p>不僅既有作品，也設置了能體感才剛公開PV的完全新作動作遊戲「緋紅狂想曲」世界觀的特別展示！ 完美重現了遊戲舞台的1920年代紐約。</p><p>米倉美優(米倉みゆ)( @0630_miyu_ )小姐扮演的艾莉・邁爾斯</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/59ae322661da34170c74235a428f556486bfbb768f90c94a348cc35ff2d9ed5f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F984a9ff608ae513bdff931d4d17a6c0d.jpg\"/><p>這裡也在特定時機出現角色扮演者！ 簡直就是遊戲主視覺本身呢・・・！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/598e2d41512b75704da295559a55a267d2ff7be3f7e7582cd13a84210ee0db1f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F7ca5e8733371e659523cd1e5f8313b11.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/13acbbdbab5c034224a584652f4bab8da9ddc84f243e5baee62be93a115373a5/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F78f794e6b2d26588b50316c895838bd3.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/149eb68bee7e7c63752490fdef6c8815c2fc2e23d46a7c629709fe8e4c8d2e74/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F8c8559d23baaf9934200509c00296cbf.jpg\"/><p>在合作作品中，設置了專屬一角的，是「 空之軌跡 the 2nd 」 展示了至今發售的周邊。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/9cc640ff8fbc73862e5eab9faf599caa67edf1023be7d214c58390696fabe00d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F60248cc81225808cce12b322ee3cb155.png\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1784e70c99b8e437e687376c6916b11a4c91d2b1cf4863a344820658ec36c861/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F01fec9b5d631096bc65c3de2a7b5478e.jpg\"/><p>更可以拿著遊戲內武器拍照！ 就我看到的範圍內，鐮刀很受歡迎。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/97f2884cc7b8ec7a737ed26aec2c7ba6fc0bb777f85b7c046cebd0d3dd237585/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fdec55f155eb12920c992d4fe64ab2c09.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c724b22a3c1a1f4a4b5fe7da3ff9e3a17cb02c72eb45cd982df595c4743f90e3/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fb040fde92794dce0ccce30a99f4d6298.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yim